  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "是函数 $y=\\sqrt{x}$ 在整个定义域里是增函数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们用反证法来证明这一事实."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设 $\\sqrt{x_2}$ 不大于 $\\sqrt{x_1}$，那么有 $\\sqrt{x_2}<\\sqrt{x_1}$ 或者 $\\sqrt{x_2}=\\sqrt{x_1}$. 如果",
        "$\\sqrt{x_2}<\\sqrt{x_1}$，因为 $\\sqrt{x_2}$ 和 $\\sqrt{x_1}$ 是非负数，那么有 $(\\sqrt{x_2})^2<(\\sqrt{x_1})^2$，",
        "即 $x_2<x_1$. 但是这和已知条件矛盾."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果 $\\sqrt{x_2}=\\sqrt{x_1}$，那么 $(\\sqrt{x_2})^2=(\\sqrt{x_1})^2$，即 $x_2=x_1$. 这也和已",
        "知条件矛盾."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，上面的假设是不可能成立的，所以 $\\sqrt{x_2}>\\sqrt{x_1}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在坐标平面上按照表中所列坐标描点，然后用平滑的曲",
        "线连结各点，就得到函数 $y=\\sqrt{x}$ 的图象（图54）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "fig",
      "label": "图54",
      "box": [
        243,
        893,
        1087,
        549
      ],
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [],
      "id": "fig-54"
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "label": "图54",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "图 54"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们要指出，函数 $y=\\sqrt{x}$ 具有下列性质：任一直线 $y=a$",
        "$(a>0)$ 和这个函数的图象都相交. 换句话说，任何正数都是",
        "这个函数的值. 例如，对于12这个数来说，当 $x=144$ 时，函",
        "数的值就等于 $12(12=\\sqrt{144})$；对于200这个数来说，当",
        "$x=40000$ 时，函数的值就等于 $200(200=\\sqrt{40000})$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "函数 $y=\\sqrt{x}$ 的值域是数射线 $[0,\\ +\\infty[$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此，函数 $y=\\sqrt{x}$ 是集合 $[0,\\ +\\infty[$ 到它自身上的映"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "215"
      ]
    }
